Decision gate for tech debt {{.id}}: "{{.title}}".

Category: {{.category}} | Severity: {{.severity}}{{if .effort_estimate}} | Effort: {{.effort_estimate}}{{end}}

Triage is complete. Choose a lane:

- TRIVIAL (effort XS-S, severity low-medium, code path well-understood, no architectural questions) →
  `shark status set {{.id}} ready_for_resolution` (skip investigation, go straight to fixing)

- NON-TRIVIAL (anything else — unclear blast radius, refactor touches multiple modules, risk of regression, or you simply don't know enough yet) →
  {{template "advance" .}} (goes to `ready_for_investigation`)

- NOT WORTH IT →
  `shark status set {{.id}} wont_fix --reason "<why>"` or `shark status set {{.id}} cancelled --reason "<why>"`

If you cannot tell which lane this falls into, default to NON-TRIVIAL — investigation is cheap insurance.
